## Implementation

Built a personal AI assistant using React, TypeScript, Node.js/Express, and the Groq API.

The application supports:

* Token-by-token streaming responses
* Thinking indicator before the first streamed token
* Stop generation during an active response
* Multi-turn conversation history
* Separate user and assistant messages
* Smart auto-scroll that does not override manual scrolling
* Mobile-friendly chat input and layout
* Server-side API key protection
* Centralized AI system prompt and model configuration

## Security

The Groq API key is stored server-side in an environment variable and is never exposed to the frontend.

## Verification

The deployed application was tested for:

